	'sto_3_p' => 'In Aiyana\'s case, an immediate in-clinic neck ultrasound with Tomas Okafor clarified the nodule\'s characteristics on the spot. Rather than making a rushed decision, they established a calm monitoring plan with evaluations every six months.',
